      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "Executor.sh is an MCP gateway that allows you to sign in once to all of your integrations and use them with any client.\r\n\r\nWe enable you to connect your agents to anything (MCP, GraphQL, OpenAPI) so regardless of what you're trying to connect agents to you're able to.\r\n\r\nIf you're trying to scale agents to access all of your production services, data, etc, you need Executor as a unified management layer.",
